 y benefit show packed with laughs and good vibes. Come support a great caus
 e while enjoying some top-notch stand-up from the best comics in the DMV. B
 ring your friends\, grab a brew\, and let’s have a blast together!<br><p>Fr
 ee entry with canned food donations. All donations will be delivered to a l
 ocal food pantry before the Holidays. Register for the event on eventbrite 
 and bring your canned food items to donate when you check in!</p><p>While t
 he show is not specifically for 21+ only\, the content will be geared towar
 ds an adult audience.</p>
