DESCRIPTION:<p>Grab your boots and get ready to kick up some dust! Dance Ki
 ng of Leesburg is bringing a Country &amp\; Craft Hoedown to Solace Brewing
  for a night of cold brews\, country moves\, and good ol’ fashioned fun!</p
 ><p>Lona Della\, owner of Vintage Cowgirl\, will also join us! Vintage Cowg
 irl has a pop-up boutique with fabulous merchandise with a country theme.</
 p><p>🎶 LIVE DJ spinning country hits &amp\; party favorites<br>👢 Beginner
 -friendly Country Swing Dance Lessons<br>🍺 Craft beer\, great vibes\, and 
 a boot-stompin’ good time<br>🤠 No partner or experience needed—just come r
 eady to dance!<br>🔥 $10 Event – Bring your friends &amp\; let’s dance!</p>
