DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/in-person-speed-dating-ag
 e-25-40-tickets-1977084246202?aff=ebdsshcopyurl&amp\;utm-campaign=social&am
 p\;utm-content=attendeeshare&amp\;utm-medium=discovery&amp\;utm-term=organi
 zer-profile&amp\;utm-share-source=organizer-profile">Register</a><br><br><b
 r><br>Stop swiping &amp\; start dating. Leave the anxiety at home &amp\; co
 me make some new friends! Go on several fast\, fun\, mini-dates in one nigh
 t.<br><br><p><strong><strong>HelloSingles®</strong></strong> is DMV's newes
 t professional singles event organizer\, specializing in matchmaking and he
 lping single adults make real connections.</p><ul><li><em><em>WHAT WE DO: P
 lay cupid.</em></em></li><li><em><em>WHAT WE DON'T DO: Boring events.</em><
 /em></li></ul><p>Our speed dating events are fast\, fun\, a lil' crazy\, an
 d always well organized.</p><p><strong><strong>What to expect:</strong></st
 rong></p><ul><li>PLEASE arrive on time. Late-comers affect the event's flow
  &amp\; we can't promise late arrivals will meet everyone during the rounds
 .</li><li>Find the check in area &amp\; Host.</li><li>Your advance ticket p
 urchase means you're on the guest list. Just provide your name for entry.</
 li><li>Obtain a name tag &amp\; hang out until everyone's checked-in. (This
  is a great time to use the restroom\, grab a cocktail\, or scan our QR cod
 e to stay updated on our IG).</li><li>Host will provide an overview of how 
 it works.</li><li>Daters will go on speed-dates lasting 4-6 minutes per dat
 e. Host will faciltate the time and movement\, making sure everyone gets a 
 chance to meet potential matches.</li><li>Complete match sheets\, take a pi
 c\, and hand it in (yes\, we love the nostalgia of old school pen &amp\; pa
 per...making you feel like a kid passing notes in class with <em><em>"Do yo
 u like me\, yes or no" </em></em>boxes).</li><li>Get your matches in 24hour
 s via email.</li></ul><p>That's it! A fun\, fast night of making new friend
 s and possible love connections.</p><p><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251206T194439Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Speed Dating at Solace Brewing Co. in Sterling
TRANSP:OPAQUE
