UID:4609tg8bosjakb920lmso57qrn@google.com
CREATED:20250606T161220Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/special-national-comedy-s
 how-live-in-sterling-tickets-1394805784649?aff=efbevent&amp\;fbclid=IwY2xja
 wKuizNleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETEwb0s4Sk5oYTNqZm0zVW81AR7ExQ2q_EhsCSWq4AkzwX5J
 HSzcXIH_06CKrkQ-PfETRo3uanR8Aoxb5wkVZA_aem_4IT9vlngPtBJqvLinrFqAA">Tickets<
 /a><br><p>Don't miss a special live comedy event at Solace Brewing Company!
 </p><p>Host <strong><b><strong><b>Lucas Bohn has been seen on NBC\, CBS\, a
 nd performing with comedy legends Jimmy Fallon\, Kevin Hart\, Dave Chappell
 e\, Larry the Cable Guy\, and more</b></strong></b></strong>. His 2nd live 
 comedy special went viral with over <em><strong><b><strong><b>50 million vi
 ews and can be found on SiriusXM\, Spotify\, Apple Music\, and Pandora.</b>
 </strong></b></strong></em></p><p>His<strong><b><strong><b> </b></strong></
 b></strong>high-energy<strong><b><strong><b> show has been called "Jeff Fox
 worthy on speed" by the Las Vegas Review and a "Comedic Masterpiece" by Par
 ade Magazine. </b></strong></b></strong>He is regularly ranked as one of th
 e top global performers for Carnival and Royal Caribbean cruise lines and h
 as performed at military bases across the US in support of our active duty 
 servicemembers.</p><p>He will be joined by two of the DMV's best comics: Ry
 an Nasser and Irwin Loring.</p><p>Ryan has performed with comedy legends <s
 trong><b><strong><b>T</b></strong></b></strong><strong><b><strong><b>om Gre
 en\, Tom Arnold\,</b></strong></b></strong> and Godfrey\, and co-hosts the 
 weekly "Comedy Open Mic" in Frederick.</p><p>Irwin was a finalist at the Co
 mic of the Year competition for Maryland\, Washington\, DC\, and Virginia. 
 He was the winner of best new talent comic at the Reading Comedy Outlet and
  a finalist in the Big Break Comedy Competition.</p><p>He has worked with c
 omedy royalty\, including <strong><b><strong><b>Michael Winslow\,</b></stro
 ng></b></strong> <strong><b><strong><b>Jimmy "JJ" Walker\,</b></strong></b>
 </strong> and <strong><b><strong><b>Dustin Diamond</b></strong></b></strong
 >. He has been a featured comedian for <strong><b><strong><b>Comcast on Dem
 and</b></strong></b></strong>.</p><p>Irwin has performed in venues ranging 
 from New York staples such as the Laugh Factory\, Comix\, Broadway Comedy C
 lub\, New York Comedy Club and Gotham Comedy Club\, to the Tropicana Hotel 
 and Casino in Atlantic City. He also participated in the Guinness Book of W
 orld Records Longest Consecutive Comedy Show.</p><p>Seating is limited\, so
  don't miss out and get your tickets quickly!</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250606T161220Z
LOCATION:42615 Trade W Dr\, Sterling\, VA 20166\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Comedy Show at Solace Brewing Co. in Sterling
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
