DESCRIPTION:\nWe need YOU to pick our featured December Holiday Themed Cock
 tail for the Sterling location. The front of house staff have been fine tun
 ing their holiday cocktail recipes and you will get to vote beginning\, Mon
 day\, November 24.\n\nAfter purchasing a cocktail flight\, you will will re
 ceive a QR code that will allow you access to the voting page to determine 
 which cocktail will be featured on our December menu.\n\nThe front of house
  team member with the winning cocktail gets bragging rights for the month (
 which is probably the biggest win!) along with an Amazon gift card for part
 icipating in our reindeer games.\n\nCocktail flights will be available begi
 nning on Monday\, November 24 through Sunday\, November 30. The results wil
 l be announced on Tuesday\, December 2.\nVoting is only available for our g
 uests 21+ years of age at the Solace location in Sterling.
LAST-MODIFIED:20251103T172908Z
LOCATION:42615 Trade W Dr\, Sterling\, VA 20166\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Spirited Cocktail Competition at Solace Brewing Co. in Sterling
