DESCRIPTION:<p>Join us at Solace in Sterling for Galentine’s Day!</p><p>Dri
 nk Specials for the ladies\, Pop-Up Boutique with local Loudoun Boss Women 
 and Galentine’s day Themed Trivia at 7PM.</p><p>First 50 ladies will receiv
 e a long stem rose from Solace to show our appreciation to you.</p><p>Drink
  Specials for the Ladies Only - $5 Full Pours of Draft Beer\, $7 Malibu Pin
 k Cocktails\, $9 Wines by the Glass and  $5 Solace Cream Sodas (Non-Alcohol
 ic)</p><p>Have a Galentine that can't make the event\, send her a postcard!
   We will have a postcard station so you can let your crew know that you we
 re thinking of them.</p><p>For the month of February\, Solace in Sterling i
 s sponsoring Women Giving Back\, a Loudoun County based organization with a
  mission of supporting women and children in crisis. A portion of the food 
 and beverage sales from Galentine's Day will go directly to Women Giving Ba
 ck.</p><p>Call your Girl Squad to celebrate the fabulousness of female frie
 ndships!</p><p><strong>Pop-Up Boutique Vendors</strong></p><p>Touchstone Cr
 ystal w/Melissa Sahay</p><p>The Fertile Bulb</p><p>Tarot Card Readings w/Ga
 il</p><p>Tattoos by Tuesday</p><p>Leesburg Beads w/Leslie Kay</p><p>Jewelry
  Bling by ME</p><p>Gabby Gill Art</p><p>Empowers Martial Arts</p><p>Damsel 
 in Defense</p><p>Scentsy w/Christin</p><p>Bellame w/Michele</p><p>Dear Buff
 alo Designs</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250209T011732Z
LOCATION:Solace Brewing Company\, 42615 Trade W Dr #100\, Sterling\, VA 201
 66\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Galentine's Day Event at Solace Brewing Co. in Sterling
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
