UID:7ecrt75hjtfb7865qgeq605c86@google.com
CREATED:20260720T195919Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Parrotheads of all ages are invited to celebrate Jimmy Buffe
 tt Day at Solace Brewing Co. in Sterling on Sunday\, August 30.  Margaritas
  and Boat Drinks!  And of course\, cheeseburgers!</p><p>Panama Rex\, a Mary
 land based Jimmy Buffett Tribute Band will be playing from 3 -6PM.</p><p>5P
 M - Brewery Wide Toast/Sing-a-Long to Jimmy Buffett's Classic Anthem</p><p>
 Tropical Hawaiian shirts are encouraged!  The louder and brighter the shirt
  the better.  A limited number of Solace branded Hawaiian shirts will be av
 ailable with a 15% discount for the day.</p><p>A portion of the sales from 
 the day will go to Save the Manatee.  An award-winning national nonprofit 5
 01(c)(3) and membership-based organization established in 1981 by Jimmy Buf
 fett\, and the late former U.S. Senator Bob Graham when he was governor of 
 Florida.</p><p>It's the perfect way to Sunday Funday!  It's Happy Hour all 
 day on Sunday at the Solace in Sterling!</p><p> </p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260720T195920Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Celebrate Jimmy Buffett Day at Solace Brewing Co. in Sterling
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
