DESCRIPTION:<p>Looking for something fun\, social\, and different to do on 
 a Saturday night?</p><p>Join Dance King at Solace for Loudoun’s easiest soc
 ial icebreaker — a beginner-friendly Latin dance mixer held on the <strong>
 <b>last Saturday of each month</b></strong> all summer long.</p><p>No partn
 er. No experience. No pressure.</p><p>Just good music\, movement\, drinks\,
  and real people actually interacting again.</p><h4>How the Night Works</h4
 ><p>We’ll kick off each hour with a short beginner-friendly lesson:</p><p><
 strong><b>6:00 PM — Merengue</b></strong><br>Easy\, upbeat\, and the perfec
 t way to loosen up.</p><p><strong><b>7:00 PM — Bachata</b></strong><br>Smoo
 th\, rhythmic\, and built around connection.</p><p><strong><b>8:00 PM — Sal
 sa</b></strong><br>Fun\, energetic\, and the perfect way to end the night.<
 /p><p>After each lesson\, we open the floor for social dancing\, drinks\, m
 ixing\, mingling\, and good vibes all night long.</p><p><br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260529T172458Z
LOCATION:42615 Trade W Dr\, Sterling\, VA 20166\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dance King Latin Mixer at Solace Brewing Co. in Sterling
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
