DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/valentines-comedy-event-2
 -national-comics-live-in-loudoun-tickets-1978194622367?aff=oddtdtcreator">T
 ickets</a><br><br><br><br>As seen on NBC\, CBS\, DryBar Comedy\, and more\,
  don't miss a special Valentine's Day national comedy event live at Solace 
 Brewing Company.<br><br><p>Don't miss a special Valentine's comedy event fe
 aturing two national comics live at the amazing Solace Brewing.</p><p>Headl
 iner Sid Davis is a three-time winner of the prestigious San Luis Obispo Co
 medy Festival and has served as the opening act for comedy legend Joan Rive
 rs. His most recent DryBar comedy special has been seen more than 3 million
  times on YouTube.</p><p>Sid will be joined by nationally touring comedian 
 Lucas Bohn.</p><p><strong><strong>Lucas has been featured on NBC's "Bring t
 he Funny" and CBS\, </strong></strong>and performed live with comedy heavyw
 eights J<strong><strong>immy Fallon\, Kevin Hart\, and Dave Chappelle</stro
 ng></strong>. His <strong><strong>show</strong></strong> has been called <s
 trong><strong>"Jeff Foxworthy on speed" by the Las Vegas Review and a "Come
 dic Masterpiece" by Parade Magazine. </strong></strong>Both of his live sta
 nd-up albums have been streamed more than 50 million times on <strong><stro
 ng>Spotify\, Apple\, Pandora\, and more.</strong></strong></p><p>Seating is
  limited\, so don't miss out and get your tickets quickly!</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251229T211056Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Valentine's Day Comedy Show at Solace Brewing Co. in Sterling
TRANSP:OPAQUE
