 will celebrate the necessity of our fabulous female friendships!<br> <br>Po
 p-Up Boutique featuring local woman owned businesses and vendors.  Because 
 there is nothing better than women supporting women!<br> <br>First 50 ladie
 s to arrive after 4PM will receive a long stem rose from Solace.<br> <br>Dr
 ink Specials for the Ladies Only - $5 Full Pours of Draft Beer\, $7 Galenti
 ne's Day Cocktails\, $9 Wines by the Glass and $5 Solace Cream Sodas (Non-A
 lcoholic).<br> <br>Johanna Horn will be our featured musician from 6 - 9PM.
 <br> <br>For the month of February\, Solace in Sterling is sponsoring Women
  Giving Back\, a Loudoun County based organization with a mission of suppor
 ting women and children in crisis. A portion of the food and beverage sales
  from Galentine's Day will go directly to Women Giving Back.<br> <br>Call y
 our Girl Squad to celebrate the fabulousness of female friendships!<br> <br
 >Have a Galentine that can't make the event\, send her a postcard! We will 
 have a postcard station so you can let your crew know that you were thinkin
 g of them.<br> <br><strong>Pop-Up Boutique Vendors Include:</strong><br>Gab
 by Gill Art<br>Scentsy w/Christin<br>Tarot Card Readings w/Gail<br>Tattoos 
 by Tuesday<br>The Fertile Bulb
LAST-MODIFIED:20251210T195426Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Galentine's Day Pop-Up Boutique at Solace Brewing Co. in Sterling
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
