DESCRIPTION:<p>Competitive puzzling at Solace in Sterling!</p><p>Each team 
 will have an opportunity to complete their 500 piece puzzle with the top th
 ree teams winning a Solace gift card. <i>To register your team contact lash
 elle@solacebrewing.com.</i> Each team is limited to four participants per t
 eam.</p><p>Each team will receive the same unopened\, brand new puzzle. Whe
 n the clock starts\, the puzzling can begin!</p><p>First Place Team: $50 Gi
 ft Card (Solace Sterling Location Only)<br>Second Place Team: $35 Gift Card
  (Solace Sterling Location Only)<br>Third Place Team: $20 Gift Card (Solace
  Sterling Location Only)</p><p>There will be a maximum of 12 teams permitte
 d to register\, so get your registration in quickly. Our last puzzling even
 t was completely full with a couple of teams on the waitlist!  </p>
