CREATED:20250208T222139Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Opinionation is a survey-based game that is fun for everyone
 ! The surveys cover a wide range of topics applicable to all adults – regar
 dless of age or trivia expertise.</p><p>During game play\, teams try to gue
 ss the five most common responses that were given to fun and engaging surve
 y questions. It’s not a test of your knowledge\, it’s a chance to get into 
 the mindset of the average person.</p><p>Each game is two rounds\, with fou
 r questions per round. Points are awarded for correct answers and the game 
 ends with both a bonus round and a final question\, which raises the stakes
  for wrong answers. The team that earns the most points is the winner!</p><
 p>Prizes for the top three teams! Free to play! A new game begins at 2PM an
 d 3PM every Sunday at Solace Brewing Co. in Sterling.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20250805T172700Z
LOCATION:Solace Brewing Company\, 42615 Trade W Dr #100\, Sterling\, VA 201
 66\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Opinionation Games at 2PM and 3PM - Solace Brewing Co. in Sterling
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
